WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:05.400
The palm and back of the hand are both one's own flesh—Zhen loves both of my sons.

00:10.320 --> 00:15.800
Formerly, your elder brother would assist Zhen at the alchemy furnace, but now he cannot come.

00:16.040 --> 00:23.000
Your Imperial Mother misses her son and cannot see him, leaving her sour-faced and constantly grumbling at Zhen.

00:25.920 --> 00:30.000
Blame this old servant for running his mouth—bringing up the Prince of Ning only brings heartache to Your Majesty.

00:31.000 --> 00:37.000
Yet the Prince of Ning has been confined for so long, he surely yearns to see Your Majesty and the Empress.

00:37.640 --> 00:42.000
Perhaps... allow the Prince of Ning to come out and attend to Your Majesty's alchemy?

00:44.760 --> 00:52.000
That eldest boy of mine is an utter disappointment! Zhen ordered him to build a canal, and he stirred the people of Qing Province into open rebellion!

00:54.080 --> 00:56.500
If Zhen simply releases him without consequence...

00:58.160 --> 01:03.520
Second Son, tell Zhen: how could I possibly justify such a deed before all under Heaven?
